<!--
  RM_Slagmole.xml                         RimMandrake: Wasteland

  WASTELAND_RULED_CONTENT_1 — full RM_ port of the donor GR_Molebear row
  (commonality 0.4). Art-sheet ruling (2026-09-29, decisions.json RM_Slagmole
  entry, "improve"): "Too much of this green stone in the back of otherwise
  terrestrial animals. Give this fella a face like a shovel and keep the
  digging front claws. Then make its back covered in rib-like structures." —
  the shipped art is the v2 regen answering that note (copied from
  infrastructure/artpipe/_artsrc/RM_Slagmole_v2_*).

  Authority: cast bible §2. Register: survivor — a barrel of muscle that digs
  through vitrified crust like frost.
-->
